@baseUrl = https://admin-direct.crefer.tech
@token = uTrjGh8NVqCjL52DnIznN37RJEf-wulT

### Get Current User Info (Me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### List All Collections
GET {{baseUrl}}/collections
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get Shorts Collection Items
# This endpoint assumes the collection name is 'shorts'
GET {{baseUrl}}/items/shorts?filter[status][_eq]=published
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get Articles Collection Items
# This is a speculative endpoint based on the project structure
GET {{baseUrl}}/items/articles?filter[status][_eq]=published
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get Fields for Shorts Collection
GET {{baseUrl}}/fields/shorts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

